{"ts":"2026-08-25T05:07:45.082Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-5.6-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"9b054e739855a3b67742faac","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-5.6-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-a8zm","lineage:pm-a8zm","lineage:pm-6x7o","lineage:pm-96h7","lineage:pm-33cw","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"pm-a8zm","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-a8zm","lineage:pm-a8zm","lineage:pm-6x7o","lineage:pm-96h7","lineage:pm-33cw","lineage:pm-doxj"]}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"## End-to-end journey\n\n- Discover supported protocol versions, server identity, core capabilities, and extensions.\n- Send any request with explicit request-local version and client capability metadata.\n- List and call deterministic token-bounded pm tools, prompts, and resources.\n- Respond to input_required results and retry the original request with inputResponses.\n- Observe request progress and opted-in list or resource changes without connection-local state.\n- Run long operations through durable task handles and application-level pm cursors.\n- Receive actionable structured refusals for unsupported versions, missing capabilities, invalid schemas, authorization failures, and expired handles.\n- Verify the same journey against a packed and published installation."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-x705zo"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"As an MCP host or coding agent, I can discover pm capabilities and complete long-running context workflows through one current stateless protocol"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"An MCP consumer can discover versions and capabilities, invoke pm tools and resources, satisfy requested input, follow progress or task state, and resume at application-level handles without hidden connection state."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Story"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-story","area:mcp","discoverability","host-story","long-running","stateless"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-08-25T05:07:45.082Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-25T05:07:45.082Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/deadline","value":"2026-10-15T00:00:00.000Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":240},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"The journey is executable over real stdio and Streamable HTTP transports; No successful operation depends on initialize state, an MCP session header, SSE redelivery, or undocumented server memory; Every response is token-bounded, deterministic where required, and exposes recovery when information is omitted; Input requests, task updates, progress, subscriptions, cancellation, and ordinary completion preserve one consistent state model; The packed and published agent transcript passes for npm, npx, bunx, and MCP consumers"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/goal","value":"One predictable current MCP experience for agents and hosts"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/objective","value":"Specify the end-to-end user outcome that all protocol, transport, task, resource, and conformance children jointly deliver"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"Integrators need fewer bespoke pm adapters and agents receive compact explainable context through standard MCP flows"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"The existing MCP experience depends on an obsolete handshake and does not expose the latest discovery, MRTR, subscription, cache, or task contracts"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-rs9vry"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-wo7x","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-08-25T05:07:45.082Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-z3ez","kind":"implements","created_at":"2026-08-25T05:07:45.082Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-25T05:07:45.082Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Duplicate check evidence: searched all statuses for MCP host story stateless discovery long-running tasks MRTR subscriptions and released-agent workflow. pm-wo7x covers drift-free narrow tools only; no existing story owns the 2026-07-28 end-to-end journey."}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"dfa3d7f45b98208b14e074ac7f813245d19ea8be9af2d71b534e2b8470e3d6de","item_hash_version":2,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}}}
