{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-15T12:36:29.752Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-fable-5-1","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"e8c571cc6c40d05f65aebb6b","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-fable-5-1","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-5f7ayv","claim:pm-extension-scalar-validation","claim:pm-gh1456","claim:pm-x705zo","lineage:pm-x705zo","lineage:pm-rs9vry","lineage:pm-5k4v","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-5f7ayv+pm-extension-scalar-validation+pm-gh1456+pm-x705zo","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-5f7ayv","claim:pm-extension-scalar-validation","claim:pm-gh1456","claim:pm-x705zo","lineage:pm-x705zo","lineage:pm-rs9vry","lineage:pm-5k4v","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.300","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-15T12:36:29.751Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Journey verification against the PUBLISHED artifact @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.15 (2026-10-15, isolated sandbox tracker, no session state):\n\nstdio via npx (-p @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.15 pm-mcp) and via bunx (bun 1.4.3), one newline-delimited stream, no initialize: server/discover returned serverInfo version 2026.10.15, supportedVersions [\"2026-07-28\"], capabilities tools/resources/prompts/extensions, cacheScope; tools/list returned 14 tools with ttlMs 30000 and cacheScope private; tools/call pm_context against the sandbox returned resultType complete with structuredContent; resources/list returned 4 resources; ping returned the allocated -32601 \"MCP method not found: ping\" with data.removedIn 2026-07-28; a legacy initialize (2025-11-25) still answered on the bounded stdio adapter with serverInfo/capabilities. Each request carried its own request-local version, client capabilities and client info; nothing depended on a prior request.\n\nStreamable HTTP via npx pm-mcp-http (PM_MCP_HTTP_PORT, loopback, POST /mcp): server/discover, tools/list (14 tools, private, ttl 30000), resources/list (4) and tools/call pm_context (resultType complete, summary active 4 / total 4) all succeeded as independent requests without a session header. Refusals were typed and actionable: an Origin that is not allow-listed is refused; a body/header method mismatch returns -32020 naming the Mcp-Method header; tools/call without Mcp-Name names that header; MCP-Protocol-Version 2024-11-05 returns \"Unsupported protocol version\" with supported [\"2026-07-28\"] and the requested value; a legacy initialize over HTTP returns \"Missing required MCP request metadata\" listing the two required _meta keys.\n\nAutomated coverage of the remaining AC facets (input_required/MRTR, tasks, subscriptions, cancellation, deterministic token-bounded outputs) is the merged test suite: tests/integration/mcp-stateless-protocol.spec.ts (12 cases incl. real stdio process), tests/integration/mcp-streamable-http.spec.ts (20 cases), tests/integration/mcp-progressive-discovery.integration.spec.ts, tests/integration/mcp-handshake.spec.ts; all 14 sibling children of pm-rs9vry are closed. The packed/published agent transcript (npm, npx, bunx) is the Release workflow step \"Verify published package on npm, npx, and bunx\" (scripts/release/verify-installed-agent-session.mjs), green for v2026.10.15 (run 38675448313).\n"}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-15T12:36:29.752Z"}],"before_hash":"26eaf1fd80b7a6fb8c57eb253b89caa6df33c33061da50489841cac834f48888","after_hash":"b5c35f812c276ef01f2e2d8fc518a465253a29056481dd0b62044691d19c9560","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"